== What this distribution contains ==

Remora's own source: the CLI and Qt workspace (src/), the mirror client (src/mirror/), the
in-image capture/input agent (agent/), the build orchestration and its patch series
(vendor/source-build/, vendor/source-patches/), and the documentation.

It contains NO third-party binaries. Every prebuilt payload a feature may stage into an Android
image — Google Apps, the ARM native-bridge libraries, Widevine, Magisk, the Play-integrity stack —
is deliberately absent, because those are not ours to redistribute. vendor/PAYLOADS.md says what
each one is and how to obtain it; a build refuses rather than silently omitting a feature whose
payload is missing. Third-party text that comes with a payload and grants no redistribution (the
Shamiko module, the Widevine and native-bridge configuration, the GApps permission files) is
absent for the same reason.


